    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d306-a1">

                <pb facs="0435" n="355" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg355"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Judge of first instance to secretary of United States
                        legation</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-08-07"><hi rendition="#italic">August 7,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>In the case instituted in this court on account of theft of a clock, I have
                    ordered that you be addressed, which I have the honor now to do, requesting that
                    you have the kindness to appear in this court between 1 and 3 p.m. to
                    testify.</p>
                <p>Very respectfully,</p>
                <closer><hi rendition="#small-caps">Criminal Judge of the Eastern
                    District.</hi></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
